  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 605.02 Scope. He-E 605 shall apply to assisted living residences, independent living retirement communities, and housing for older persons in accordance with RSA 161-J.\n\nSource. #13443, eff 9-9-22",
